# bd's JSONL export and audit log are not tracked (2026-10-23). The export was
# tracked from 2026-07-27 as a recovery floor, after a stray rm -rf took out a
# Dolt store that existed on one laptop only. Since then every change reaches
# refs/dolt/data on GitHub with `bd dolt push`, which is the off-machine copy;
# the tracked export only duplicated it and conflicted whenever two branches
# carried it. `bd export -o <file>` writes one on demand.
.beads/*.jsonl

